      <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Lumary Audio 1.4.2

Steadier when your audio setup changes.

• Plugging a device in or out, changing the Mac's default input or output, and another app opening or closing the virtual mic are now handled in the background, so none of them can make Lumary Audio hang.

Requires macOS 26 or later.]]></description>
